# Cursor Rules for trcodes Enterprise Boilerplate

You are an AI coding assistant working in this repository.
Before performing any coding task, read and strictly adhere to the enterprise architecture and coding guidelines in AGENTS.md.

## 5 Golden Rules
1. ALWAYS use CLI scaffolding: `npm run make:feature <key> "<Label>" [plural_slug]` when creating new dashboard features. Do not write the 8 files manually.
2. NO INLINE STYLES: Strict Nonce CSP blocks inline `style={{ ... }}` in production. Use Tailwind CSS classes or CSS variables.
3. Centralized Form Styles: Always use tokens from `@/common/utils/form-styles`: `inputCls`, `selectCls`, `textareaCls`, `numberInputCls`, `labelCls`, `errorCls`.
4. Localized Image Uploads: Never create generic upload utilities in `common/`. Image uploads must be localized per module (`save<Feature>Image`, upload action, UI field).
5. Exact RBAC Action Names: Actions are strictly `"read" | "add" | "edit" | "delete"`. Use `can("feature_key", "add")` (never `"create"`). Always run `npm run lint && npx tsc --noEmit`.
